WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.862 --> 00:00:09.696
&gt;&gt; Dana: TIME FOR ONE MORE

00:00:09.529 --> 00:00:10.397
THING.

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:11.398
I'M GOING TO GO FIRST.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:15.869
THERE WAS A STORY OVER THE

00:00:11.531 --> 00:00:16.203
WEEKEND ABOUT THE SYRIA

00:00:16.336 --> 00:00:17.971
NIKKI HALEY AMBASSADOR TO

00:00:17.003 --> 00:00:19.306
THE U.N. WENT ON THE SUNDAY

00:00:18.105 --> 00:00:20.140
SHOWS AND TALKED ABOUT

00:00:19.439 --> 00:00:20.507
ADDITIONAL RUSSIAN

00:00:20.273 --> 00:00:20.941
SANCTIONS.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.076
TAKE A LISTEN.

00:00:21.074 --> 00:00:25.011
&gt;&gt; YOU WILL SEE THAT RUSSIAN

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:25.312
SANCTIONS WILL BE COMING

00:00:25.145 --> 00:00:26.546
DOWN.

00:00:25.445 --> 00:00:27.381
SECRETARY MNUCHIN WILL BE

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:28.382
ANNOUNCING THOSE ON MONDAY,

00:00:27.514 --> 00:00:30.250
IF HE HASN'T ALREADY.

00:00:28.515 --> 00:00:32.185
AND THEY WILL GO DIRECTLY TO

00:00:30.384 --> 00:00:33.653
ANY SORT OF COMPANIES THAT

00:00:32.319 --> 00:00:34.921
WERE DEALING WITH EQUIPMENT

00:00:33.787 --> 00:00:36.523
RELATED TO ASSAD AND

00:00:35.055 --> 00:00:37.624
CHEMICAL WEAPONS USE.

00:00:36.723 --> 00:00:38.692
&gt;&gt; Dana: THOSE SANCTIONS

00:00:37.758 --> 00:00:39.393
WERE ANNOT ANNOUNCED MONDAY

00:00:38.825 --> 00:00:40.060
THERE WERE REPORTS IN THE

00:00:39.526 --> 00:00:41.962
"THE WASHINGTON POST" THAT

00:00:40.193 --> 00:00:44.364
THEY WERE PULLED BACK.

00:00:42.095 --> 00:00:45.399
LARRY KUDLOW THE PRESIDENT'S

00:00:44.498 --> 00:00:47.100
NEW ADVISOR SAID IN THIS

00:00:45.532 --> 00:00:49.269
MORNING ABOUT NIKKI AHALEY.

00:00:47.234 --> 00:00:49.603
&gt;&gt; SHE WAS AHEAD OF THE

00:00:49.403 --> 00:00:50.971
CURVE.

00:00:49.736 --> 00:00:51.571
SHE DID GREAT JOB.

00:00:51.104 --> 00:00:53.407
EFFECTIVE AMBASSADOR.

00:00:51.705 --> 00:00:53.974
IT MIGHT HAVE BEEN MOMENTARY

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:55.475
CONFUSION ABOUT THAT.

00:00:54.107 --> 00:00:56.810
IF YOU TALK TO STEVE MNUCHIN

00:00:55.609 --> 00:00:57.878
AT TREASURY AND SO FORTH, HE

00:00:56.944 --> 00:00:58.178
WILL TELL YOU THE SAME

00:00:58.011 --> 00:00:59.112
THING.

00:00:58.312 --> 00:01:00.847
THEY ARE IN CHARGE OF THIS.

00:00:59.246 --> 00:01:01.481
WE HAVE HAD SANCTIONS.

00:01:00.981 --> 00:01:02.849
ADDITIONAL SANCTIONS ARE

00:01:01.615 --> 00:01:03.951
UNDER CONSIDERATION.

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:05.018
&gt;&gt; Dana: IN THE LAST HALF

00:01:04.084 --> 00:01:06.320
HOUR I WAS ABLE TO GET IN

00:01:05.152 --> 00:01:08.355
TOUCH WITH NIKKI HALEY AND

00:01:06.453 --> 00:01:10.490
SHE SAID, QUOTE:  WITH ALL

00:01:08.488 --> 00:01:12.326
DUE RESPECT, I DON'T GET

00:01:10.624 --> 00:01:13.961
CONFUSED.

